# Rclex — Services (server & client)

```elixir
Mix.install(
  [
    {:rclex, github: "FelixPe/rclex"}
  ],
  config: [
    rclex: [
      ros2_message_types: ["std_msgs/msg/String"],
      ros2_service_types: ["std_srvs/srv/SetBool"]
    ]
  ]
)
```

## About

A `std_srvs/srv/SetBool` server that toggles an in-memory flag, and a client
that calls it asynchronously.

Reference implementations:

* C++ — [ros2/demos · `demo_nodes_cpp/services/add_two_ints_server.cpp`](https://github.com/ros2/demos/blob/rolling/demo_nodes_cpp/src/services/add_two_ints_server.cpp)
  and [`add_two_ints_client_async.cpp`](https://github.com/ros2/demos/blob/rolling/demo_nodes_cpp/src/services/add_two_ints_client_async.cpp)
* Python — [ros2/demos · `demo_nodes_py/services/add_two_ints_server.py`](https://github.com/ros2/demos/blob/rolling/demo_nodes_py/demo_nodes_py/services/add_two_ints_server.py)
  and [`add_two_ints_client_async.py`](https://github.com/ros2/demos/blob/rolling/demo_nodes_py/demo_nodes_py/services/add_two_ints_client_async.py)

Test from another terminal:

```sh
ros2 service call /set_bool std_srvs/srv/SetBool "{data: true}"
```

## Generate

```elixir
Mix.Task.run("rclex.gen", [])
Application.stop(:rclex)
Application.unload(:rclex)
{:ok, _} = Application.ensure_all_started(:rclex)

alias Rclex.Pkgs.StdSrvs
:ok
```

## Server

```elixir
Rclex.start_node("livebook_server")

Rclex.start_service(
  fn %StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool.Request{data: enable} ->
    IO.puts("[server] received #{inspect(enable)}")

    %StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool.Response{
      success: true,
      message: if(enable, do: "enabled", else: "disabled")
    }
  end,
  StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool,
  "/set_bool",
  "livebook_server"
)
```

## Client

`start_client/5` takes a callback that fires when a response arrives.

```elixir
Rclex.start_node("livebook_client")

Rclex.start_client(
  fn %StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool.Response{} = response ->
    IO.puts("[client] response: #{inspect(response)}")
  end,
  StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool,
  "/set_bool",
  "livebook_client"
)

# Give the server a moment to be discovered.
Process.sleep(500)

:ok =
  Rclex.call_async(
    %StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool.Request{data: true},
    "/set_bool",
    "livebook_client"
  )
```

## Cleanup

```elixir
Rclex.stop_client(StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool, "/set_bool", "livebook_client")
Rclex.stop_service(StdSrvs.Srv.SetBool, "/set_bool", "livebook_server")
Rclex.stop_node("livebook_client")
Rclex.stop_node("livebook_server")
```
